<title>USA: InnerDyne signs manufacturing pact.</title>
<headline>InnerDyne signs manufacturing pact.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>InnerDyne Inc said Friday it had signed a binding letter of intent giving rights to Shearwater Polymers Inc to manufacture and offer for third-party purchases InnerDyne's proprietary polyethylene glycols.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, InnerDyne will receive royalties related to any sales of its polymer through Shearwater.</p>
<p>In addition, InnerDyne will establish a potential commercial source of the compound for its internal use, as well as for licensees under current and future coating licensing agreements, InnerDyne said.</p>
<p>InnerDyne designs, develops and manufactures minimally invasive surgical access products.</p>
</text>
